{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "016sei_401_2_4_016_01_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:fe2e8bf5a8ffdad488316dc3ba47536251e4d3bf10adbe614f202550568224e0",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:016sei_401_2_4_016_01_09_a:2_4_016_01_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48499bb77706d0a7959cfffed7828005a2c262da6b39f3324aa5a7f511193bd7",
      "text": "喂，●●●●プロデューサー。\n新春演唱会辛苦了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:016sei_401_2_4_016_01_09_a:2_4_016_01_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55e52884eb0152eb6427fd129757874c89c15ff599174ed9fe97251df55c9d79",
      "text": "我自信这是一场配得上拉开新年序幕的演唱会。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:016sei_401_2_4_016_01_09_a:2_4_016_01_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e1529bf024de4da2682b493476ad6a4d2b2a72b0af338079be66be0eb4af3a5",
      "text": "说起来，我昨天和天音一起去新年参拜了。\n虽然离家有点远，但去的是举办演唱会的那家神社。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:016sei_401_2_4_016_01_09_a:2_4_016_01_09_a:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9cbf1ec81e74be3dac8470181afd5eea95f31e8c46327422f71c733086e7f29f",
      "text": "是天音坚持无论如何都想去那里。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:016sei_401_2_4_016_01_09_a:2_4_016_01_09_a:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc0fed08b12879498ffd32108b196cfbeb521133166b716ec3d387647d8c854f",
      "text": "然后，看她拜得那么虔诚，\n我就问了她许了什么愿。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:016sei_401_2_4_016_01_09_a:2_4_016_01_09_a:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:060b70c19ecb36ff29cdc7913c756742aeb6f88ddd9d3d10b3b168116ab1f121",
      "text": "结果你猜她怎么说的？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:016sei_401_2_4_016_01_09_a:2_4_016_01_09_a:cmd-000017:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:90a761cf0c1459b1e01fab2cd48264d3d1deb2c64706b964941d057ffa8b05b7",
      "text": "是关于诚司先生的事吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:016sei_401_2_4_016_01_09_a:2_4_016_01_09_a:cmd-000020:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c589ee3d25cd535664ff91fdf038d6752d43f173b5afbafcac2c10a2601dce00",
      "text": "没错！\n她祈愿的是我的偶像工作顺顺利利。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:016sei_401_2_4_016_01_09_a:2_4_016_01_09_a:cmd-000022:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14c9c3b370f6a18629c6da821d350ae77e3616684007f635515e72ea8ad14a4c",
      "text": "这让我再次鼓足了干劲，\n这一年一定要好好努力做好偶像工作才行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:016sei_401_2_4_016_01_09_a:2_4_016_01_09_a:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:007eb2968c3caa8a54bd563c92e41e5e2a033a95131ec8290cfc15b384b91657",
      "text": "所以，我想马上开始练习。明天，\n能帮我预约一下练习室吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:016sei_401_2_4_016_01_09_a:2_4_016_01_09_a:cmd-000026:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f849bd4b259b0a77a76987307a4502b6410c80d87cabf16a09de7629f6a81656",
      "text": "当然可以！\n我这就安排",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:016sei_401_2_4_016_01_09_a:2_4_016_01_09_a:cmd-000027:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45266c1085436ef44d1ccad9ae6b2bec4dc20788bf0640c3eb4603e2a129438b",
      "text": "明白了！\n定在几点呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:016sei_401_2_4_016_01_09_a:2_4_016_01_09_a:cmd-000030:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c118c5565c5cf4095b48afa4ac5851ff4e70601ea1dfc151e8049b4d19273fc",
      "text": "谢谢。\n我稍后把期望的时间段发给你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:016sei_401_2_4_016_01_09_a:2_4_016_01_09_a:cmd-000034:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc873e05f564ab52a4254edc8138d80ce4411f1302530d63d63f4fda6fa13ffb",
      "text": "多谢。如果能从午后开始预约就帮大忙了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:016sei_401_2_4_016_01_09_a:2_4_016_01_09_a:cmd-000038:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce7e25621bf2b1b6df93a57f7cbc62a65d1790cdde6fb94e83cf2fa72e40ec16",
      "text": "那么，就拜托你了，\n●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
